    "title": "Three-bedroom home sells in Jim Thorpe for $155,000 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Real Estate Newswire ,\n9 hours ago A 1,478-square-foot single-family home, built in 1993, has changed hands. The house at 83 Drakes Drive in Jim Thorpe was sold on May 1 for $155,000, or $105 per square foot. This single-story house has three bedrooms and one bathroom. The property is equipped with electric heating and central A/C. The lot of the property covers an area of 2 acres. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
